"""
Catalogue of minimum aberration two-level fractional factorial designs.

``_MA_GENERATORS[(n_factors, n_runs)] = (resolution, generators)``: the first
``log2(n_runs)`` factors are the base factors, and generator ``i`` defines factor
``log2(n_runs) + i`` as the product of the listed base factors (0-based).

Generators as tabulated in Mee, R. W. (2009), "A Comprehensive Guide to Factorial
Two-Level Experimentation", Springer, Appendix G, Tables G.1-G.3, G.4a and G.5a
(8 to 128 runs), converted from Yates column numbers (bit i of the column
number is base factor i). The 4-run design is the half fraction C = AB.

One correction: for design 22-17.1 (32 runs) the book lists "Design 23-18.1,
minus 27", which does not reproduce the word length pattern printed next to it,
(A3, A4, A5) = (48, 263, 832); removing column 22 instead does, so that is used.
"""

